    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll The Dice</strong> to summon items, enemies, and bosses! Then, use what you roll to craft tools and survive the island's unpredictable challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842150/extras/175ffb1d0e388ee50a8fc42837775b51.poster.avif?t=1753982312\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842150/extras/175ffb1d0e388ee50a8fc42837775b51.webm?t=1753982312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842150/extras/175ffb1d0e388ee50a8fc42837775b51.mp4?t=1753982312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect special gems from enemies that when combined start intense <strong>Boss Fights</strong> that will leave you and your robot friends appalled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842150/extras/10e9db587aa47a2c9f6bc39e04b69c3a.poster.avif?t=1753982312\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842150/extras/10e9db587aa47a2c9f6bc39e04b69c3a.webm?t=1753982312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842150/extras/10e9db587aa47a2c9f6bc39e04b69c3a.mp4?t=1753982312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this crazy luck-filled adventure with up to 4 people, <strong>Free</strong> of charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awesome Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dice Rolling</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crafting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PVE / CO-OP </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Chat</p></li></ul>",
